        "runId": "ada-en-work-mw8vthz3-pj2doqdxd9n",
        "model": "ChatGPT (Codex)"
      },
      "text": "You have two days at leisure on Barú Island. With no scheduled excursions, you can unwind by the Caribbean Sea. We leave these days open after a busy programme in Bogotá, Medellín and Cartagena. Spend the day on the beach, take a walk along the shore or enjoy the hotel facilities at your own pace.\n\nBreakfast, lunch and dinner are included on both days."
